<Heading level="2"><TitleText>DIVISION 1 Requirements</TitleText></Heading>
<Section lims:inforce-start-date="2015-06-12" lims:lastAmendedDate="2024-11-08" lims:fid="20" lims:id="20"><MarginalNote>Work and study</MarginalNote><Label>30</Label><Subsection lims:inforce-start-date="2015-06-12" lims:fid="21" lims:id="21"><Label>(1)</Label><Text>A foreign national may not   work or study unless</Text><Paragraph lims:fid="22" lims:id="22"><Label>(a)</Label><Text>authorized; or</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph lims:fid="23" lims:id="23"><Label>(b)</Label><Text>exempt under</Text><Subparagraph lims:fid="24" lims:id="24"><Label>(i)</Label><Text>the regulations,</Text><Clause lims:fid="25" lims:id="25"><Label>(A)</Label><Text>as a student, or</Text></Clause></Subparagraph></Paragraph><Paragraph lims:fid="26" lims:id="26"><Label>(c)</Label><Text><Repealed>[Repealed, 2012, c. 17, s. 1]</Repealed></Text></Paragraph></Subsection><Subsection lims:fid="27" lims:id="2700"><MarginalNote>Authorization</MarginalNote><Label>(1.1)</Label><Text>An officer may authorize it.</Text></Subsection><HistoricalNote><HistoricalNoteSubItem>2012, c. 17, s. 1</HistoricalNoteSubItem></HistoricalNote></Section>
<Section lims:inforce-start-date="2018-07-31" lims:lastAmendedDate="2018-07-31" lims:fid="30" lims:id="30"><Label>11.1</Label><Text><Repealed>[Repealed, 2015, c. 36, s. 170]</Repealed></Text></Section>
<Heading level="2"><TitleText>DIVISION 2 Interpretation</TitleText></Heading>
<Section lims:fid="40" lims:id="40"><MarginalNote>Definitions</MarginalNote><Label>2</Label><Text>The definitions in this section apply.</Text><Definition lims:fid="41" lims:id="41"><Text><DefinedTermEn>fee</DefinedTermEn> means a charge for</Text><Paragraph lims:fid="42" lims:id="42"><Label>(a)</Label><Text>examinations.</Text></Paragraph></Definition></Section>
